{
  "id": "add-users",
  "version": 2,
  "title": "Add users to the system: manual setup, invite link and import",
  "lang": "en",
  "app_version": "preprod-2026-10-11",
  "viewport": {
    "width": 1920,
    "height": 1080
  },
  "start": {
    "url": "https://app-pre-production.sloneek.com/app/dashboard-v2",
    "local_storage": {
      "local-translate": "en"
    }
  },
  "voice": {
    "provider": "external",
    "voice_id": "7jQ3jNk3Fcw65sWUmzun",
    "model_id": "eleven_v4"
  },
  "chapters": true,
  "interstitials": true,
  "thumbnail": {
    "shot": "s19",
    "title": "Adding users"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "narration": "A new colleague is starting and you're not sure where to begin? Hi, I'm Maria from the Sloneek team, and I'll show you how to add users.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_staff",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "800"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_staff",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      },
      "part": 1,
      "part_title": "Introduction",
      "hold_after_ms": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "narration": "In the left menu, under Company, I expand Users and open Management.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_company_staff",
          "before_ms": 1200
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_settings_users",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=tableRow]",
          "value": "15000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=addUserButton]",
        "url_contains": "/app/settings/users"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "narration": "Here you see all active users with their team, position, and roles. You can search by name, email, team, role, position, or tag.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] table thead",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1500"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] .p-datatable-header",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=tableRow]",
        "url_contains": "/app/settings/users"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "narration": "You can add users manually with the Add button, send them a link with Invite, or import them from Google Workspace and Office 365.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=addUserButton]",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "900"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=inviteButton]",
          "before_ms": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "900"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] button:has-text(\"Import users\")",
          "before_ms": 200
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=inviteButton]",
        "url_contains": "/app/settings/users"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "narration": "Let's start manually. I click Add, and the Create a new user form opens.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=addUserButton] button",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=addUserButton] button",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=usersCreateForm] [data-cy=firstNameInput]",
          "value": "15000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=usersCreateForm]",
        "url_contains": "/app/company-details/member/new"
      },
      "part": 2,
      "part_title": "Basic information"
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "narration": "First, the account status. Emily starts in a few weeks, so I choose The user is not active.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=userInactiveRadio]",
          "before_ms": 1800
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=hirePacketSelect]",
        "url_contains": "/member/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "narration": "An inactive user can't log in, gets no emails, and you don't pay a license for them. It's the perfect state for preparing a new hire's start.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=usersCreateForm] .user-activation-box .text-hint",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=usersCreateForm] .user-activation-box .text-hint",
        "url_contains": "/member/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "narration": "Only the name, surname, and email are required. I'll enter Emily Carter.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=firstNameInput]",
          "value": "Emily",
          "clear": true,
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=surnameInput]",
          "value": "Carter",
          "clear": true,
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=surnameInput]",
        "url_contains": "/member/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "narration": "I enter her work email. Once she's activated, her invitation to Sloneek goes to this address.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=emailInput]",
          "value": "emily.carter@example.com",
          "clear": true,
          "before_ms": 400,
          "speed": "fast"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=emailInput]",
        "url_contains": "/member/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "narration": "The option to hide the email from other colleagues hides the address in the Colleagues section. It's handy for a private email, for example.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=usersCreateForm] nb-checkbox:has-text(\"Hide email from other colleagues\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=usersCreateForm] nb-checkbox",
        "url_contains": "/member/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "narration": "Special user rights add roles on top of a regular user. I'll open the list, but I won't select anything.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=userRolesSelect] button",
          "before_ms": 1200
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "nb-option[data-cy=userRole-admin]",
          "value": "5000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "nb-option-list",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "nb-option[data-cy=userRole-ombudsman]",
        "url_contains": "/member/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "narration": "An administrator manages the whole app and sees all data. A document manager or an asset manager has full access only to their own module.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "nb-option[data-cy=userRole-admin]",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "2200"
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "nb-option[data-cy=userRole-document_manager]",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1200"
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "nb-option[data-cy=userRole-property_administrator]",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "nb-option[data-cy=userRole-admin]",
        "url_contains": "/member/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "narration": "A reporting administrator can access all reports, and only the ombudsman can read the trust box. A regular colleague needs none of these.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "nb-option[data-cy=userRole-reporting]",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "2000"
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "nb-option[data-cy=userRole-ombudsman]",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1800"
        },
        {
          "type": "press",
          "value": "Escape",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=userRolesSelect] button:has-text(\"Special user rights\")",
        "url_contains": "/member/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "narration": "I set the type of employment relationship to Employee. You can also choose contractor, freelance, or internship.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=employmentTypesSelect] button",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "nb-option[data-cy=employmentType-contractor]",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-option[data-cy=employmentType-employee]",
          "before_ms": 900
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=employmentTypesSelect] button:has-text(\"Employee\")",
        "url_contains": "/member/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "narration": "On the right are more work details. In the Date of joining the company field, I enter her first working day.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=joinDateInput]",
          "before_ms": 1000
        },
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=joinDateInput]",
          "value": "{{DATE:+21d:MM/DD/YYYY}}",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-calendar nb-calendar-day-cell.selected",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=joinDateInput]",
        "url_contains": "/member/new"
      },
      "part": 3,
      "part_title": "Work details"
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "narration": "The start date is saved to the profile history. Sloneek doesn't calculate pro-rated leave on its own, though; you set that in the user's absences.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=joinDateInput]",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=joinDateInput]",
        "url_contains": "/member/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "narration": "I pick the position from the list, here Customer Support Specialist. You can add new positions through the Manage positions link.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=positionSelect] button",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-option[data-cy=\"positionOption-Customer Support Specialist\"]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] a:has-text(\"Manage positions\")",
          "before_ms": 500
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=positionSelect] button:has-text(\"Customer Support Specialist\")",
        "url_contains": "/member/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "narration": "I add Emily to the Customer Support team. The team determines her manager and who approves her absences and attendance.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamsSelect] button",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-option[data-cy=\"team-Customer Support\"]",
          "before_ms": 500
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=teamsSelect] button:has-text(\"Customer Support\")",
        "url_contains": "/member/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "narration": "And the work location, here our Prague office. You can fill in the other details anytime later.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=workLocationSelect] button",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-option[data-cy=workLocation-Praha]",
          "before_ms": 500
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=workLocationSelect] button:has-text(\"Praha\")",
        "url_contains": "/member/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "narration": "All done, so I click Create user. Sloneek immediately asks whether I want to assign a type of work contract.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=usersCreateForm] [data-cy=submitButton]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=usersCreateForm] [data-cy=submitButton]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=confirmationDialog]",
          "value": "15000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=confirmationDialog] [data-cy=submitButton]",
        "url_contains": "/member/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "narration": "The type of work contract sets her working hours, which her attendance and absence balances are calculated from. I choose Yes.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=confirmationDialog] [data-cy=submitButton]",
          "before_ms": 2500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "nb-dialog-container slnk-common-autocomplete",
          "value": "10000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "nb-dialog-container slnk-common-autocomplete",
        "url_contains": "/member/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s22",
      "narration": "I select Full-time 40 h. It's valid from her start date, I tick Indefinite period, and save.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-dialog-container slnk-common-autocomplete",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "slnk-common-autocomplete-option:has-text(\"Full-time 40 h\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-dialog-container nb-checkbox label",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-dialog-container button:has-text(\"Save\")",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] a[href$=\"/contracts-and-terms\"]",
          "value": "15000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] a[href$=\"/work-data\"]",
        "url_contains": "/work-data"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s23",
      "narration": "Emily now has her own user profile. The header shows she's still inactive.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "slnk-common-header-autocomplete .text-danger:text-is(\"(Inactive)\")",
          "value": "10000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "slnk-common-header-autocomplete .selected-item-container",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "slnk-common-header-autocomplete .text-danger:text-is(\"(Inactive)\")",
        "url_contains": "/work-data"
      },
      "part": 4,
      "part_title": "User profile",
      "voice_after_actions": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s24",
      "narration": "The tabs hold personal information, contract and payroll, absences, documents, assets, and the change history.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] ul.route-tabset",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] a[href$=\"/history\"]",
        "url_contains": "/work-data"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s25",
      "narration": "The Contract and Payroll tab shows her full-time contract. You can also add remuneration here.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] a[href$=\"/contracts-and-terms\"]",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=companyMemberContractsAndTerms] [data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Full-time 40 h\")",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=companyMemberContractsAndTerms] [data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Full-time 40 h\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1200"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=companyMemberContractsAndTerms] button:has-text(\"Add new remuneration\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=companyMemberContractsAndTerms] [data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Indefinite period\")",
        "url_contains": "/contracts-and-terms"
      },
      "voice_after_actions": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "s26",
      "narration": "You set managers and approvers in the Teams section. If a team has no manager, administrators approve the requests.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] a[href$=\"/work-data\"]",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamsSelect]",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=teamsSelect]",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=teamsSelect] button:has-text(\"Customer Support\")",
        "url_contains": "/work-data"
      },
      "voice_after_actions": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "s27",
      "narration": "Before you activate Emily, check her language. In the Notifications and Integrations tab, English is already set, so I just confirm it and save.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] a[href$=\"/interface-settings\"]",
          "before_ms": 1200
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=companyMemberInterfaceSettings] nb-select",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=companyMemberInterfaceSettings] nb-select button",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "nb-option:text-is(\"English\")",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=companyMemberInterfaceSettingsSaveButton]",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1200"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=companyMemberInterfaceSettings] nb-select button:has-text(\"English\")",
        "url_contains": "/interface-settings"
      },
      "part": 5,
      "part_title": "Activation"
    },
    {
      "id": "s28",
      "narration": "Her invitation and the app will be in English. When Emily starts, open Actions and choose Activate.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] button:has-text(\"Actions\")",
          "before_ms": 1500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "nb-context-menu a:has-text(\"Activate\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1500"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] button:has-text(\"Actions\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] button:has-text(\"Actions\")",
        "url_contains": "/interface-settings"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s29",
      "narration": "Once activated, she gets an email with a link to set her password, sees her assigned documents, and you start paying her license.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] button:has-text(\"Actions\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] button:has-text(\"Actions\")",
        "url_contains": "/interface-settings"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s30",
      "narration": "Back in the overview, I switch the filter to Only inactive. Emily is here, ready for her first day.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a#navigation_settings_users",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=tableRow]",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainContentCenterDiv] p-select:has-text(\"All users\")",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "li[role=option]:has-text(\"Only inactive\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait_ready",
          "selector": "[data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Carter Emily\")",
          "value": "15000"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Carter Emily\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=tableRow]:has-text(\"Carter Emily\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/settings/users"
      },
      "part": 6,
      "part_title": "Other ways to add users",
      "voice_after_actions": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "s31",
      "narration": "The second way is Invite. Sloneek creates a company link that you can send to colleagues by email or in a chat.",
      "actions": [
